      "updated": 1791363391532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: same seat-number formula as Stage 0,\ndone once for x and y.\n\nRefresher: The global index formula from Stage 0 is:\nmy position = block number x block size + seat in the block\n\nNote: This is the \"mapping threads onto data step\"\nbut in a 2-dimensional context.",
